  "Correct Answer": "90",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "A right angle is 90 degrees.\n\nAlternative method 1: Calculate the displayed sum\n\nCombine the tens and ones in the displayed sum:\n\\[45+45=(40+40)+(5+5)=80+10=90.\\]\nThus the requested number is \\(90\\), and the angle measures \\(90^\\circ\\).",
